      "writtenOn": "2020-12-10T23:48:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Each of these suspend/resume functions should cancel any pending deferred calls going the other direction to ensure they won\u0027t interfere. If the system resumes immediately after suspending, LTE might be left powered off because lte_power_suspend() could be called after lte_power_resume().\n\n    hook_call_deferred(\u0026lte_function_suspend_data, -1);\n    hook_call_deferred(\u0026lte_power_suspend_data, -1);\n    lte_power_resume();\n    hook_call_deferred(\u0026lte_function_resume_data, 10 * MSEC);",
      "revId": "7edda8ceb22517035f68144334da85a671719b5b",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
